# VESPER HALL 2F -- landing, music room (W), trophy room / back stair (E)
# Tileset: TILESET_MANSION. 15x7 blocks, buffer 273/1300.
# The twin 06 stairs sit in the same blocks as on 1F, so each flight lands
# where it left. Straight ahead (door 17) is the sealed Master Suite: a maid
# NPC stands in front of it until the burglars are beaten.
# The back stair (05, x12) climbs to the rooftop observatory terrace.
# Burglars ("guests" who came for the collection) hold the landing.
# Gap: no beds in TILESET_MANSION, so bedrooms live in the Master Suite map
# (players_house tileset) instead of on this floor.
ref CeladonMansion2F
tileset mansion
key ,=02 .=03 W=04 <=05 >=06 w=07 v=08 p=09 r=0a |=0b c=0c B=0f O=10 P=11 k=12 n=13 D=17 K=18 h=1b C=1c !=20
grid:
PBPrW>pDp>!P<KB
,,,|......!....
,C,|......!.O..
,h,c...........
vvvv......!....
..........!vvvv
...............
end
exit STAIR_W 11 0
exit STAIR_E 19 0
exit SUITE 15 0
exit ROOF 24 0
obj npc 15 1 MaidAtDoor down
obj trainer 8 5 BurglarSid right 4
obj trainer 22 9 BurglarJo left 4
obj trainer 2 7 PianistLass right 2
obj trainer 26 4 GentlemanG down 3
obj item 0 12 MaxRepel
obj sign 9 0 PlaqueLeft
